    "detailed_description": "Hyperskate thrusts you into a massive, real-world-scale sci-fi environment where speed and agility are your greatest assets. In this high-octane VR adventure, explore vast alien landscapes, soar to breathtaking heights, and race through futuristic mega-structures at speeds of up to 300mph. Seamlessly join friends or venture solo in drop-in, drop-out multiplayer, all while upgrading your hoverboard and rider for maximum performance. The mysteries of an ancient, alien world await\u2014can you uncover humanity's purpose in the cosmos?",
